    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Saturday, December 18, 2021 at 8 p.m. (EST)Richmond Hill Centre for the Performing Arts Under the direction of Maestro Kristian Alexander, the Kindred Spirits Orchestra performs a night of exceptional and evocative music. Tchaikovsky’s poignant Cappriccio Italien is a musical travelogue painting the landscape of the composer’s journey to Rome. Internationally acclaimed violinist Conrad Chow &hellip;  REFLECTIONS Read More &raquo;"
      }
